{"ID":"20240205164745-buzxijq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164745-buzxijq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164745-buzxijq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102834-rxg8v44\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612101013-859ioh7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626103234-xxopywy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:12\u0026#125;","title":"214山茱萸","type":"doc","updated":"20240821113432"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102834-rxg8v44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102834-rxg8v44","updated":"20240206102843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河南省、浙江省、陕西省等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈不规则的片状或囊状。表面紫红色至紫黑色，皱缩，有光泽。顶端有的有圆形宿萼痕，基部有果梗痕。质柔软。气微，味酸、涩、微苦。\n【性味】\t酸、涩，微温。\n【功效】\t补益肝肾，涩精固脱。用于眩晕耳鸣，腰膝酸痛，阳痿遗精，遗尿尿频，崩漏带下，大汗虚脱，内热消渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102835-7m0kj28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102835-7m0kj28","updated":"20240206102835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102835-vojisnq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165350-96vsg1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165350-96vsg1c","updated":"20240205165350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山茱萸-20240205165350-t71344w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626102908-pphjbbb","Type":"NodeParagraph",